- GRU (no Brazilian DST since 2019) and BOG (never observes) stay fixed at UTC−3 and UTC−5 across the US changeover on 1 November.
- 28/10 `SIM` and 05/11 `SBY` show MAD–MAD with no flight number, no STD/STA and no block time — training and standby respectively, whose report is the stated window start with no offset applied.

